# Full trim, batch 05: document viewers, with the shared graphics libraries kept.
#
# Vetted list. tools/build-live.sh applies these files in numeric order with:
#
#     apt-get purge -y --auto-remove <the names below>
#
# The order is part of the verification: this working copy was purged with
# these batches in this order, and the full product anchors were checked after
# every batch. Do not merge or reorder the files.
#
# libpoppler-glib8t64 and libpoppler-qt6-3t64 are NOT in this list: GIMP,
# Inkscape and Krita link them. gsfonts-other and the Ghostscript libraries
# are kept for GIMP's PostScript support. okular and the standalone document
# tools can go without taking the graphics product with them.
#
# This is the reduced list measured on the graphics branch. The unreduced
# audio-only batch removed GIMP, Inkscape, Krita and Skanpage from the full
# image; the full image ships all three disciplines, so it must keep them.

okular
okular-data
okular-doc
okular-extra-backends
libokular6core4
libqmobipocket6-3
poppler-utils
mupdf-tools
libmupdf27.0
python3-fitz
python3-pymupdf
python3-mupdf
libqpdf30
# ghostscript and gsfonts stay: GIMP links libgs10 and uses the Ghostscript
# PostScript stack. They are a graphics runtime here, not a document viewer.
